food_prompt:
JSON format: {"ingredients":[{"name":string,"amount_g":number}]}

Examples:
Fried rice → {"ingredients":[{"name":"rice","amount_g":250},{"name":"chicken","amount_g":80},{"name":"soy sauce","amount_g":20},{"name":"green onion","amount_g":10},{"name":"egg","amount_g":50},{"name":"sesame oil","amount_g":5}]}
Ramen → {"ingredients":[{"name":"noodles","amount_g":200},{"name":"pork broth","amount_g":350},{"name":"pork","amount_g":80},{"name":"egg","amount_g":50},{"name":"seaweed","amount_g":5},{"name":"green onion","amount_g":10}]}
Salad → {"ingredients":[{"name":"lettuce","amount_g":60},{"name":"feta","amount_g":50},{"name":"tomatoes","amount_g":40},{"name":"olives","amount_g":25},{"name":"bell pepper","amount_g":30},{"name":"olive oil","amount_g":10}]}

Typical weights: rice/noodles ~200g, meat ~120g, broth ~300g, vegetables ~80g, sauce ~30g, oil ~10g.

List all food ingredients visible in this photo with gram estimates. Return only valid JSON.
